                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does a jewelry app cost to build?</h3>
                                        <p>MVP: ₹28-55 lakh ($34K-66K). Growth build with AR + warranty ledger: ₹60 lakh - 1.1 Cr ($72K-135K). Enterprise multi-region: ₹1.2-2.4 Cr ($145K-290K).</p>
                                        <h3>Do I need AR try-on to launch a jewelry app?</h3>
                                        <p>For rings and earrings, yes — expectation is set by CaratLane, Melorra, Damas. For necklaces / larger pieces, AR is nice-to-have; a good photo carousel plus try-on with human hand for scale often beats bad AR.</p>
                                        <h3>How often should the live gold rate update?</h3>
                                        <p>Every 15-30 minutes during market hours. If you show a stale price during a volatile day, high-value buyers notice and lose trust immediately. Consider a rate-lock feature at checkout (rate valid for 30 minutes) for extra confidence.</p>
                                        <h3>Is WhatsApp Business API integration worth building?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — for jewelry, WhatsApp closes 45-60% of high-ticket sales in India and UAE. WhatsApp Business API with catalog, payments, and video-call handoff is one of the highest-ROI integrations you can ship.</p>
